<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> fsharp\n\n:= get_solutions () =\n    [\n        \"A\",\n        \\ (a, _b) =>\n            a\n\n        \"B\",\n        \\ (_a, b) =>\n            b\n    ]\n\n:= ^ empty_2_tests () =\n    := test_cases = [\n        (\"a\", \"a\"), \"a\"\n        (\"b\", \"b\"), \"b\"\n    ]\n\n    := solutions = get_solutions ()\n\n\n    := count =\n        ? is_fast ()\n        ?> 1000i32\n        |: 2000000i32\n\n    run_all (reflection::nameof { empty_2_tests }) count solutions test_cases\n    |> sort_result_list\n\nempty_2_tests ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> fsharp

  := get_solutions () =
      [
          "A",
          \ (a, _b) =>
              a

          "B",
          \ (_a, b) =>
              b
      ]

  := ^ empty_2_tests () =
      := test_cases = [
          ("a", "a"), "a"
          ("b", "b"), "b"
      ]

      := solutions = get_solutions ()


      := count =
          ? is_fast ()
          ?> 1000i32
          |: 2000000i32

      run_all (reflection::nameof { empty_2_tests }) count solutions test_cases
      |> sort_result_list

  empty_2_tests ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

